    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37492" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξοικοδομ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>build,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.176
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.62
			</span></i>; <i>make a building good,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				22.463.48
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνην μεγάλην ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pherecr.
					94
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.48.11
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξῳκοδόμηταί σοι τὸ τεῖχος</span>”
				<i>is finished,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					1124
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. κρημνόν</span>
			<i>build up a road along</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.55.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>unbuild, lay open,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς πύλας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					11.21
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Dio</u>
				50
			</span></i>.</div>
